WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:06.820
The gods gave us many gifts,

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.180
one day you'll know them all

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.720
This is where we keep them

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.080
It's beautiful

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:17.940
Who would weild it?

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.000
 

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.540
Only the fiercest among us even could, and that is not you Diana

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.980
You will train her harder, than any amazon before her

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.540
5 times harder

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:36.420
10 times harder

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:41.280
Never let your guard down. You expect the battle to be fair?

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.380
Until she is better than even you!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:52.680
But she must never know the truth about what she is...

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:05.960
"What is this place? Who are you?"

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:08.140
It is our sacred duty to defend the world

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:08.920
Right.

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:14.040
Whoever you are, you are in more danger than you think

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:16.860
Be careful Diana

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.720
If no one else will defend the world, then I must

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.660
Welcome to jolly ol' London!

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:23.880
It's hideous

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:25.560
Yeah it's not for everybody

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:27.980
Stand back

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.800
Or maybe not...

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.200
is there anything else you wanna show me?

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:56.800
What are you?

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:01.400
I am Diana of Themyscira, daughter of [Queen] Hippolyta

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:06.400
In the name of all that is good, till wrath upon this world is over

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:15.420
Oh

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:17.540
yep... that's not going to work

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:18.860
please put the sword down

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:19.960
it doesn't go with the outfit, at all...

